    <string name="load_measure_note">Latency includes application queues and processing. State mode includes delivery to all connected clients and their receipts to the host. Percentiles use successful exchanges only; timeouts are separate. B/s excludes Bluetooth/Wi-Fi overhead and is not radio throughput.</string>
    <string name="load_stop_note">Cancel stops generation; fragments already submitted to the SDK may still arrive. A timeout means no complete receipt before the deadline, not proven radio packet loss.</string>
