    <string name="migration_note">Planned handoff: stop load, verify snapshot, switch roles and rediscover. Compare new codes on the Connection tab. Time includes manual verification. After a disconnect, stop the old connection and choose a new host with its snapshot; other devices search again. This lab has no leader election or partition consensus.</string>
    <string name="physical_note">Router-free operation needs separate physical testing. Android or iPhone can host. An active foreground session keeps the screen awake; OS background restrictions still apply.</string>
